        "created_at": "2015-01-08T21:09:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ok, I'm just looking for a quick clarification about how Captain Cosmic works - in particular, what happens when Constructs are destroyed.</p><p>So, Sustained Influence, Destructive Response, and PWCC's innate power are all linked to when a Construct is destroyed. If I'm reading it right, you CAN trigger Sustained Influence and Destructive Response (dealing damage, then returning the Construct to play), but you CANNOT trigger PWCC's innate power with either one because the text says \"you may shuffle it into your deck&nbsp;instead\" so no destruction actually occurs.</p><p>Is this correct?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:15.450Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
