        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Ok, I&#39;m just looking for a quick clarification about how Captain Cosmic works - in particular, what happens when Constructs are destroyed.</p><p>So, Sustained Influence, Destructive Response, and PWCC&#39;s innate power are all linked to when a Construct is destroyed. If I&#39;m reading it right, you CAN trigger Sustained Influence and Destructive Response (dealing damage, then returning the Construct to play), but you CANNOT trigger PWCC&#39;s innate power with either one because the text says &quot;you may shuffle it into your deck&nbsp;<u>instead</u>&quot; so no destruction actually occurs.</p><p>Is this correct?</p>",
