        "created_at": "2015-01-09T00:55:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Responses to destruction occur as the card hits the trash, so you can't time even the damage from destructive response to be before you shuffle it in, because the option to shuffle it in will necessarily come before the damage or putting it back into play.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:00:30.639Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
